{%- comment -%}
  fye-shop-chooser — "What are you looking for?", asked before the products
  on /collections/all. 1 use: templates/collection.json. That template is
  shared by every collection, so the section renders only on the collection
  whose handle matches `show_on` (default `all`).

  WHY IT EXISTS (Ed, 09/10/2026, T354). ALL holds every product on the site.
  The xCloud filter rail is one global list, so on ALL it showed every facet at
  once. The chooser routes the shopper to the collection whose rail is built
  for that family. The grid stays below, behind "Or browse all jewellery".

  V2, 09/10/2026: rebuilt to the Claude Design handoff (design_handoff_shop_
  chooser, frame 2b). Block types changed from product_type / ring_type to
  category / sub_option so that ANY category can carry a second question.
  This section has one use and was a day old, so the rename was safe; the
  JSON template was rewritten in the same release.

  CONTENT MODEL
  - `category` blocks (Rings, Bracelets, Necklaces, Earrings, Gemstones,
    Diamonds). `key` ties sub-options to their parent.
  - `sub_option` blocks, each naming its parent by `parent_key`.
  - Anything whose collection is unset or empty is not rendered on the live
    site, so a category appears by itself once its collection has products.
    In the theme editor everything renders, marked, so it can be set up.
  - A category with one or more live sub-options becomes a toggle and gets a
    panel. Any other category is a plain link to its collection.

  NO JAVASCRIPT: a toggle is an ordinary link to its category's collection.
  fye-ui.js (SHOP CHOOSER block) upgrades it to role="button", opens one
  panel at a time, fades it in (opacity only, never height), returns focus on
  close and, on phones, scrolls the opened panel's heading into view.

  DEPARTURES FROM THE HANDOFF, deliberate:
  - Type sizes snap to the nearest fye-core token (within 2px of the spec)
    rather than carrying literal px values (conventions §3).
  - Soft text uses --ink-soft (0.72). The handoff's 0.62 is not a token and
    measures about 3.9:1 on white, under the 4.5:1 body text needs.
  - Vertical rhythm comes from --sect-y via .band (64px here), not from
    separate top and bottom paddings.
  - The 560-899 tile columns follow the handoff table exactly; 749 is unused.

  The one extra-specific selector at the foot of the stylesheet hides the
  xCloud rail while the chooser is on the page: keyed to the chooser's
  presence, so switching the chooser off brings the rail straight back.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign show_on = s.show_on | default: 'all'

  assign show = false
  if collection.handle == show_on
    assign show = true
  endif

  assign editing = request.design_mode

  comment
    Pass 1: which sub-options are live, per parent key, and how many
    categories will render. Live = collection set and holding products.
  endcomment
  assign live_parents = ','
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'sub_option'
      assign sc = block.settings.collection
      if sc != blank and sc.products_count > 0
        assign pk = block.settings.parent_key | strip | downcase
        assign live_parents = live_parents | append: pk | append: ','
      endif
    endif
  endfor

  assign cat_count = 0
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'category'
      assign cc = block.settings.collection
      assign ck = block.settings.key | strip | downcase
      assign needle = ',' | append: ck | append: ','
      if editing or live_parents contains needle or cc != blank and cc.products_count > 0
        assign cat_count = cat_count | plus: 1
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  if cat_count > 6
    assign cat_count = 6
  endif
-%}

{%- if show and cat_count > 0 -%}
<section class="pick band band--white" data-screen-label="Shop chooser">
  <div class="wrap wrap--wide pick__wrap">

    <div class="pick__head">
      {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="pick__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="pick__title">{{ s.heading | default: 'What are you looking for?' }}</h2>
    </div>

    <ul class="pick__grid" role="list" data-count="{{ cat_count }}">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type != 'category' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign b = block.settings
          assign c = b.collection
          assign key = b.key | strip | downcase
          assign needle = ',' | append: key | append: ','
          assign c_live = false
          if c != blank and c.products_count > 0
            assign c_live = true
          endif
          assign has_subs = false
          if live_parents contains needle
            assign has_subs = true
          endif
          if editing
            for sb in section.blocks
              if sb.type == 'sub_option'
                assign spk = sb.settings.parent_key | strip | downcase
                if spk == key
                  assign has_subs = true
                endif
              endif
            endfor
          endif
          assign live = false
          if c_live or has_subs
            assign live = true
          endif
          assign label = b.title | default: c.title
          comment
            Without JavaScript a toggle is a link: to its own collection, or,
            while that is unpublished or empty, to its first live sub-option.
          endcomment
          assign href = '#'
          if c_live
            assign href = c.url
          elsif has_subs
            for sb in section.blocks
              if sb.type == 'sub_option'
                assign spk = sb.settings.parent_key | strip | downcase
                assign sc = sb.settings.collection
                if spk == key and sc != blank and sc.products_count > 0
                  assign href = sc.url
                  break
                endif
              endif
            endfor
          endif
          assign panel_id = 'pick-panel-' | append: block.id
        -%}
        {%- unless live or editing -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
        <li class="pick__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <a class="pick__tile{% if b.image == blank %} pick__tile--text{% endif %}{% unless live %} is-empty{% endunless %}"
             href="{{ href }}"
             {%- if has_subs %} data-fye-pick="{{ panel_id }}" aria-controls="{{ panel_id }}" aria-expanded="false"{% endif %}>
            {%- if b.image != blank -%}
              <span class="pick__media">
                {{ b.image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '400, 600, 800', sizes: '(max-width: 560px) 33vw, (max-width: 900px) 33vw, 16vw', class: 'pick__img', alt: '' }}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="pick__label">
              <span class="pick__words">
                <span class="pick__name">{{ label }}</span>
                {%- if b.note != blank -%}
                  <span class="pick__note">{{ b.note }}</span>
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- unless live -%}
                  <span class="pick__note">Hidden on the live site until its collection has products</span>
                {%- endunless -%}
              </span>
              {%- if has_subs -%}
                {%- render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 18, class: 'pick__icon pick__icon--closed' -%}
                {%- render 'icon', name: 'chevron-up', size: 18, class: 'pick__icon pick__icon--open' -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right', size: 18, class: 'pick__icon' -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>

    {%- comment -%} One panel per category with sub-options, all after the grid. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      {%- if block.type != 'category' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign b = block.settings
        assign c = b.collection
        assign key = b.key | strip | downcase
        assign panel_id = 'pick-panel-' | append: block.id
        assign q_id = 'pick-q-' | append: block.id

        assign sub_count = 0
        for sb in section.blocks
          if sb.type == 'sub_option'
            assign spk = sb.settings.parent_key | strip | downcase
            if spk == key
              assign sc = sb.settings.collection
              if editing or sc != blank and sc.products_count > 0
                assign sub_count = sub_count | plus: 1
              endif
            endif
          endif
        endfor
        assign question = b.question | default: 'Which kind?'
      -%}
      {%- if sub_count == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      <div class="pick__panel" id="{{ panel_id }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="{{ q_id }}" hidden>
        <div class="pick__bar">
          <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="pick__q" id="{{ q_id }}">{{ question }}</h3>
          <button type="button" class="pick__close" data-fye-pick-close aria-label="Close">
            <span class="pick__closeword">Close</span>
            {%- render 'icon', name: 'close', size: 18 -%}
          </button>
        </div>

        <ul class="pick__subs" role="list" data-count="{{ sub_count }}">
          {%- for sb in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if sb.type != 'sub_option' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign sbs = sb.settings
              assign spk = sbs.parent_key | strip | downcase
              assign sc = sbs.collection
              assign s_live = false
              if sc != blank and sc.products_count > 0
                assign s_live = true
              endif
            -%}
            {%- if spk != key -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- unless s_live or editing -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
            <li class="pick__subitem" {{ sb.shopify_attributes }}>
              <a class="pick__sub{% unless s_live %} is-empty{% endunless %}" href="{% if s_live %}{{ sc.url }}{% else %}#{% endif %}">
                <span class="pick__words">
                  <span class="pick__subname">{{ sbs.title | default: sc.title }}</span>
                  {%- if sbs.note != blank -%}
                    <span class="pick__note">{{ sbs.note }}</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- unless s_live -%}
                    <span class="pick__note">Hidden on the live site until its collection has products</span>
                  {%- endunless -%}
                </span>
                {%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right', size: 18, class: 'pick__icon pick__icon--wide' -%}
                {%- render 'icon', name: 'chevron-right', size: 18, class: 'pick__icon pick__icon--phone' -%}
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>

        {%- if c != blank and c.products_count > 0 and b.see_all_label != blank -%}
          <p class="pick__more">
            <a class="pick__link" href="{{ c.url }}">
              <span class="pick__linkword">{{ b.see_all_label }}</span>
              {%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right', size: 16 -%}
            </a>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}

    {%- if s.browse_label != blank -%}
      <p class="pick__browse">
        <a class="pick__link" href="#grid">
          <span class="pick__linkword">{{ s.browse_label }}</span>
          {%- render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 16 -%}
        </a>
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
/* Literal px values in this block (44, 64, 96, 112, 124, 128, 148, 6, 10)
   are the handoff's measured sizes for tap targets and tile heights, which
   have no token. Everything else is a fye-core token. */

/* --- section ------------------------------------------------------------ */
.fye .pick { --sect-y: var(--s10); }
.fye .pick__wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }

.fye .pick__head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--s3); margin-bottom: var(--s8); text-align: center; }
.fye .pick__eyebrow {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-eyebrow);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}
/* 40px hairline either side of the heading, 20px off it (handoff). */
.fye .pick__title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--s5);
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
  font-size: var(--fs-h3);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-h2);
  line-height: 1.3;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.fye .pick__title::before,
.fye .pick__title::after { content: ""; flex: none; width: var(--s8); height: 1px; background: var(--ink); }

/* --- step 1 grid: column count follows the number of live categories ---- */
.fye .pick__grid {
  --gap: var(--s6);
  --cols: 3;
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--gap);
}
.fye .pick__grid[data-count="4"] { --cols: 4; }
.fye .pick__grid[data-count="5"] { --cols: 5; }
.fye .pick__grid[data-count="6"] { --cols: 6; }
.fye .pick__item { margin: 0; flex: none; width: calc((100% - (var(--cols) - 1) * var(--gap)) / var(--cols)); min-width: 0; }

.fye .pick__tile {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--white);
  border: var(--hairline);
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease), color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__media { display: block; background: var(--ivory); aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; overflow: hidden; }
.fye .pick__img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }

.fye .pick__label {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--s3);
  padding: var(--s4) var(--s5);
  transition: background-color var(--dur) var(--ease), color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__tile--text .pick__label { min-height: 128px; }
.fye .pick__words { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s1); min-width: 0; }
.fye .pick__name {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h4);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-h2);
  line-height: 1.3;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__note { font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: var(--fw-light); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fye .pick__icon { flex: none; }
.fye .pick__icon--open { display: none; }

/* hover, pressed, selected. Colour and border only: no transform. */
.fye .pick__tile:hover { border-color: var(--sage); }
.fye .pick__tile:hover .pick__name,
.fye .pick__tile:hover .pick__icon { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .pick__tile:active { border-color: var(--sage-deep); }
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] { border-color: var(--ink); }
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] .pick__label { background: var(--ink); color: var(--ivory); }
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] .pick__name,
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] .pick__note,
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] .pick__icon { color: var(--ivory); }
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] .pick__icon--closed { display: none; }
.fye .pick__tile[aria-expanded="true"] .pick__icon--open { display: block; }
.fye .pick__tile.is-empty,
.fye .pick__sub.is-empty { border-style: dashed; }

/* --- step 2 panel: one pattern for every category ------------------------ */
.fye .pick__panel {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: var(--s7);
  padding: var(--s9) var(--s9) var(--s7);
  background: var(--ivory);
  opacity: 1;
  transition: opacity var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__panel.is-fading { opacity: 0; }

.fye .pick__bar {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr 96px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: var(--s6);
}
.fye .pick__q {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
  font-size: var(--fs-h4);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-h2);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: center;
}
.fye .pick__close {
  justify-self: end;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--s2);
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: none;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-button);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__close:hover { color: var(--sage); }

.fye .pick__subs {
  --gap: var(--s6);
  --slots: 5;
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--gap);
}
.fye .pick__subitem { margin: 0; flex: none; width: calc((100% - (var(--slots) - 1) * var(--gap)) / var(--slots)); min-width: 0; }
.fye .pick__sub {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--s4);
  height: 100%;
  min-height: 148px;
  padding: var(--s6);
  background: var(--white);
  border: var(--hairline);
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: border-color var(--dur) var(--ease), color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__sub .pick__words { gap: 6px; }
.fye .pick__subname {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--fs-h4);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-h2);
  line-height: 1.3;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__icon--wide { align-self: flex-end; }
.fye .pick__icon--phone { display: none; }
.fye .pick__sub:hover { border-color: var(--sage); }
.fye .pick__sub:hover .pick__subname,
.fye .pick__sub:hover .pick__icon { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .pick__sub:active { border-color: var(--sage-deep); }

/* --- links: "See all ..." and "Or browse all jewellery" ------------------- */
.fye .pick__more { margin: var(--s4) 0 0; text-align: center; }
.fye .pick__browse { margin: var(--s9) 0 0; text-align: center; }
.fye .pick__link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--s2);
  min-height: 44px;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-button);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: color var(--dur) var(--ease);
}
.fye .pick__browse .pick__link { font-size: var(--fs-small); }
.fye .pick__linkword { padding-bottom: 3px; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; }
.fye .pick__link:hover { color: var(--sage); }

/* fye-collection-intro collapses the top padding of whatever follows it,
   because the listing it was written for brings its own. The chooser does
   not, so its eyebrow sat against the teal edge (measured 09/10/2026).
   `.band.pick` so this outranks the collapse rule, one class shorter. */
.fye .shopify-section:has(> .cintro) + .shopify-section > .band.pick { padding-block-start: var(--sect-y); }

/* The chooser replaces the xCloud rail on this page: see the file comment. */
.fye:has(.pick) .coll__rail { display: none; }
.fye:has(.pick) .coll__layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }

/* --- 560 to 899 ----------------------------------------------------------- */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fye .pick { --sect-y: var(--s9); }
  .fye .pick__grid { --gap: var(--s4); }
  .fye .pick__grid[data-count="5"],
  .fye .pick__grid[data-count="6"] { --cols: 3; }
  .fye .pick__label { padding: var(--s3) var(--s4); }
  .fye .pick__tile--text .pick__label { min-height: 112px; }
  .fye .pick__panel { margin-top: var(--s6); padding: var(--s7) var(--s7) var(--s4); }
  .fye .pick__subs { --gap: var(--s4); --slots: 3; }
  .fye .pick__subs[data-count="4"] { --slots: 2; }
  .fye .pick__sub { min-height: 124px; padding: var(--s5); }
}

/* --- under 560 ------------------------------------------------------------ */
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .fye .pick { --sect-y: var(--s8); }
  .fye .pick__head { margin-bottom: var(--s6); }
  .fye .pick__grid { --gap: var(--s2); }
  .fye .pick__grid[data-count="4"] { --cols: 2; }
  .fye .pick__media { aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
  .fye .pick__label { justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; padding: 10px 6px; text-align: center; }
  .fye .pick__tile--text .pick__label { min-height: 88px; }
  .fye .pick__label .pick__note,
  .fye .pick__label .pick__icon { display: none; }
  .fye .pick__name { font-size: var(--fs-fine); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  .fye .pick__panel { margin-top: var(--s5); padding: var(--s3) 0 var(--s1); }
  .fye .pick__bar { grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr 44px; margin-bottom: var(--s2); }
  .fye .pick__closeword { display: none; }

  /* Phone: a full-width list, not tiles. */
  .fye .pick__subs { display: block; border-top: var(--hairline); background: var(--white); }
  .fye .pick__subitem { width: auto; border-bottom: var(--hairline); }
  .fye .pick__sub {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 64px;
    padding: var(--s3) var(--s4);
    border: 0;
  }
  .fye .pick__subname { font-size: var(--fs-small); }
  .fye .pick__sub .pick__note { font-size: var(--fs-fine); line-height: 1.4; }
  .fye .pick__icon--wide { display: none; }
  .fye .pick__icon--phone { display: block; }
  .fye .pick__more { margin-top: var(--s2); }
  .fye .pick__browse { margin-top: var(--s6); }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .fye .pick__panel { transition: none; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shop chooser",
  "class": "pick-sect",
  "max_blocks": 30,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "show_on",
      "label": "Show on collection",
      "default": "all",
      "info": "The handle of the one collection this appears on. It is hidden on every other collection page."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Start here" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "What are you looking for?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "browse_label", "label": "Link to the products below", "default": "Or browse all jewellery" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "category",
      "name": "Category",
      "limit": 6,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "key", "label": "Key", "info": "Short id, for example rings. Sub-options name their category by this key." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "note", "label": "Note" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image", "info": "4:3, cropped square on phones." },
        { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Collection" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "question", "label": "Second question", "info": "Shown when this category has sub-options." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "see_all_label", "label": "See all link label" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_option",
